Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Forms|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Configure Autofill Rule
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|pending|
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Data Providers
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Data Provider
	And FormsAdmin edit Data Provider
		|name|Liferay Countries|
		|outputParameterName|Country Name|
		|outputParameterPath|nameCurrentValue|
		|outputParameterType|List|
		|password|test|
		|url|${portalURL}/api/jsonws/country/get-countries|
		|username|test@liferay.com|
	And FormsAdmin save Data Provider
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Description
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Select from List|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Countries|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Rules
	And FormRules add Rule
	And FormRules configure Condition Options
		|conditionField|Text Field|
		|conditionFieldValue|country|
		|conditionOperator|Contains|
		|conditionRowNumber|1|
		|conditionValueType|Value|
	And FormRules configure Action Options
		|action|Autofill|
		|actionRowNumber|1|
		|actionTarget|Liferay Countries|
	And FormRules select Autofill Output
		|dataProviderOutput|Countries|
	And FormRules save
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Form Builder
	And Form save
	And Page add
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Form Page|
		|portletName|Form|
	And FormPortletNavigator goto Select Form
	And FormPortletConfiguration select Form
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And FormFields view Text Label
		|fieldLabel|Text Field|
		|fieldName|TextField|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|TextField|
		|fieldValue|test|
	And FormFields view Select Options List
		|fieldName|Countries|
		|selectOption|Option|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|TextField|
		|fieldValue|country|
	Then FormFields view Select Options List
		|fieldName|Countries|
		|selectOption|Afghanistan|
